Implementation
- close.rs::Intent::prepare captures the actual full Scene split path, ratios,
  tab, swarm, revision and generation. The IO State confirms only matching
  registry metadata, restores the saved split and sidebar order, and emits the
  exact retained notice once. Delayed metadata and foreign op ids are covered.
- main.rs::close_request and headless.rs::CloseFor share validation/admission.
  The pane close hit and Cmd+Z use the native retained layout/focus path.
- AppStatus.close is optional, bounded retained UI readback with omission
  counts/complete; no new reader, lifecycle authority or timer. The startup
  readiness pipe clears that field so large UI state cannot overflow it.
- closed_strip.rs is the shared native sidebar grace row. Countdown and drain
  use the authoritative remaining deadline; the product uses existing frame
  pacing and existing pane components. Undo retains PID/generation and position.
- bboxybook close cases route four public lab poses through native components,
  native split solving, independent semantic diagnostics and the canonical gate.
  No renderer or shared layout-solver edits. Geometry/pixel policy unchanged.

